<decision #track.enable_continuous_mission_execution.execution_mode {
  kind = "planning-decision"
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = ["behavior" "templates" "tests"]
  frontier = false
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.98
  reversibility = "moderate"
}
(
  <question ?>mission 是否应在启动或完成单条 track 后默认停止？</?>
  <options { } [
    <option { key = "continuous" recommended = true }
    (
      <title ?>连续执行</?>
      <description ?>启动后立即落地；每次动作后重新 observe -> reconcile，直到明确暂停条件。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>单次执行可能更长，但状态持续从 mission.xml 重读。</?>
    )
    >
    <option { key = "single-step" recommended = false }
    (
      <title ?>单步执行</?>
      <description ?>每次 invocation 只执行启动或一个 mission 动作。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>需要频繁人工续跑，且会造成启动后或单 track 后停下。</?>
    )
    >
  ]>
  <answer { status = "accepted" }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>开始实现就是直接落地；去掉 bounded action；仅在待决策确认、blocked 或终态时停止。</?>
    <decision-text ?>mission 默认连续执行，不再存在 start-only 或每动作默认停止语义。</?>
    <rationale ?>mission 的职责是跨 track 长时间自主收敛，而不是把每个控制步骤暴露为人工续跑点。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户明确列出连续执行、停止条件和动作后重新 observe -> reconcile 的要求。</?>
  )>
)
[
  <decision #track.enable_continuous_mission_execution.track_budget {
    kind = "planning-decision"
    priority = "P0"
    status = "accepted"
    blocks = ["mission-action" "mission-spec" "tests"]
    frontier = false
    durable_candidate = true
    confidence = 0.96
    reversibility = "easy"
  }
  (
    <question ?>连续执行是否需要动作数上限？</?>
    <answer { status = "accepted" }
    (
      <raw-answer ?>不要 max-actions；最多连续执行 10 个 track。</?>
      <decision-text ?>仅引入 `max-tracks=10` 的 invocation checkpoint，按完成的 track 生命周期计数。</?>
      <rationale ?>限制跨 track 连续工作量，同时不把普通分析、绑定或验证动作人为切碎。</?>
      <evidence ?>用户明确要求不使用 max-actions，改为最多连续执行 10 个 track。</?>
    )>
  )>
]
>

<decision #track.enable_continuous_mission_execution.action_verification {
  kind = "planning-decision"
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  blocks = ["behavior" "templates" "tests"]
  frontier = false
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.98
  reversibility = "moderate"
}
(
  <question ?>成功动作后是否必须无条件完整 observe -> reconcile？</?>
  <options { } [
    <option { key = "verification-driven" recommended = true }
    (
      <title ?>动作内验证后条件收敛</?>
      <description ?>每个动作用与影响相称的完成判定；验证通过且无失效信号时直接继续，只有不确定或偏差时才观察受影响范围并 reconcile。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>动作必须明确自己的完成判定，但避免每步重复执行全量控制环。</?>
    )
    >
    <option { key = "mandatory-reconcile" recommended = false }
    (
      <title ?>每动作完整收敛</?>
      <description ?>每个成功动作后都重新 observe -> reconcile。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>协议简单但对连续 mission 造成重复观察与重算。</?>
    )
    >
  ]>
  <answer { status = "accepted" }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>不要复杂回执或 XNL 格式；每个动作有自己的完成判定，验证通过且无偏差就继续，只有不确定或偏差才观察和收敛。</?>
    <decision-text ?>采用验证驱动的条件观察与 reconcile，不引入动作回执协议。</?>
    <rationale ?>多样动作无需共享持久化回执格式；行动本身已有相称的测试、状态或证据。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户否决复杂 XNL 回执方案并明确同意动作内完成判定方案。</?>
  )>
)
>
